From cb0f71a1b4663e0725aace6365abf950bca2b93f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 06:39:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add Slow Bloom product page, bag drawer, and commerce
 schema

- /shop is now the Slow Bloom product page (specs, what's included,
  quantity capped at the 10-kit batch, add to bag, reviews empty state)
- Slide-in bag drawer + header bag icon (front-end-only cart for now;
  checkout disabled until Stripe is wired up)
- Homepage countdown auto-reveals the Latest Drop section at release time
- Prisma commerce schema, cost calculator (+ tests), reservation logic,
  and db:seed script

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012WaFXB7ZStPCrgjGNusLz5
